{ dg-modules "rcprelude" }
{ Rosetta Code, task "Case-sensitivity of identifiers", ALGOL 68 solution case-sensitivity-of-identifiers-1.alg.
  https://rosettacode.org/wiki/Case-sensitivity_of_identifiers#ALGOL_68
  The text of Rosetta Code is available under the GNU Free Documentation
